  "abstract_summary": "This paper proposes DyMC-YOLO, an efficient RGB\u2013infrared object detector based on YOLOv13. The evaluated infrared modalities include thermal infrared in the M3FD benchmark and near-infrared in a self-constructed RGB\u2013NIR grape dataset. To balance cross-modal interaction with computational cost, the model integrates a...",
